                                                "sense_id": "f5bfec49-9b7b-3992-a71c-c9b1b587484e",
                                                "text": "2008, \"Scientists Pinpoint Pathway That Impacts Features of Autism\", 8 October 2018, R&D Magazine.\nMoreover, effects were seen in adult mice, suggesting a possible route to medication development for adults with autism spectrum disorder (ASD)."
